  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.18.0: Loam.Pickers ColorPicker validation — adds a Validation delegate (Func<Color,string?>) and a public Validate(), completing validation across all four field pickers. Runs on every value change (palette select, editable hex commit, programmatic), self-gates to preserve manual error state, and lets editable parse errors take precedence. No Required (Value is non-null). Additive, off by default. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
